WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:04.260
Hello everybody! My name is Markiplier and welcome back to "The Joy Of Creation: Reborn".

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:09.340
Now I have had, the WORST time, trying to get this video to you.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:12.380
Let me explain how bad this morning has gone.

00:00:12.380 --> 00:00:17.500
I got up at 5am this morning because I wanted to record this video and get it for 8am

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:19.680
and I was gonna do it and I was gonna beat it

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:22.520
and everything was gonna be fine and everything WAS going fine.

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:27.380
I was learning the map, I was learning everything about Chica, I was learning how to beat her.

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:32.320
And it got pretty easy, and I actually memorized every location of the page.

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.300
And I did this, because if you beat all of the animatronics,

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:38.640
you get a special secret bonus ( OH SOUNDS FUN )

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:40.660
that I'm gonna show you guys in a little bit.

00:00:42.140 --> 00:00:44.080
(Distraught) But at the end of the bonus,

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:46.500
it just closes the game.

00:00:47.600 --> 00:00:49.580
And that may not seem like a bad thing,

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.820
but a little behind the scenes on Let's Plays:

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:54.640
if you're recording, and I'm not recording in 'windowed mode'

00:00:54.640 --> 00:00:56.560
I'm just hooking into the game directly.

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:00.060
If it closes, without me stopping recording,

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:03.700
there's like a 50/50 shot of it just corrupting the file.

00:01:04.100 --> 00:01:06.340
So I've been recording for two hours!

00:01:06.620 --> 00:01:08.820
And that chance of corruption goes UP!

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:11.360
The longer you've been recording, so

00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:12.540
I lost it.

00:01:13.120 --> 00:01:14.520
And I could recover it,

00:01:15.080 --> 00:01:18.480
but it usually cuts off the last, like, 10% of the video

00:01:18.480 --> 00:01:20.020
which was the bonus.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:21.620
So...

00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:24.320
THEN I went do it AGAIN

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:26.400
and I was trying to play Chica again

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.620
and I thought I LOSING MY MIND

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:32.700
because I was wandering the woods and there's NO PAGES!

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.460
'CAUSE ONCE YOU BEAT IT, THE PAGES ARE GONE

00:01:35.780 --> 00:01:38.500
AND YOU HAVE TO RESET THE GAME TO DO IT AGAIN!

00:01:39.520 --> 00:01:44.180
So I have had-- I am so sorry that this video is so incredibly late,

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.100
that things have been off-schedule because

00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:49.340
I've also been working my own, Matt hasn't been able to edit for me

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:51.320
for like 3 weeks, so I've been doing everything

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:53.920
with the trips, and the other projects that we've been working on.

00:01:53.920 --> 00:01:56.500
So, I have been BURIED under work,

00:01:56.500 --> 00:01:59.360
which is why I got up at 5am, 'cause I had to work late last night

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:00.780
